{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22488","headline":"晚归有感 · 白居易","name":"晚归有感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝吊李家孤，暮问崔家疾。\n回马独归来，低眉心郁郁。\n平生所善者，多不过六七。\n如何十年间，零落三无一。\n刘曾梦中见，元向花前失。\n渐老与谁游，春城好风日。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22488.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22488","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","citation":"霍松林"}